; Nested blocks for the solved-entrance tests: the entrance i2 sits in
; inner, which nests side, so inner stays a node while side becomes a
; trip. outer fixes o1 and reaches inner through a qualified shot.
*begin outer
*fix o1 0 0 0
*data normal from to tape compass clino
o1 o2 10.0 0 0
o2 inner.i1 5.0 90 0

*begin inner
*entrance i2
i1 i2 8.0 0 0
i2 side.s1 4.0 180 0

*begin side
s1 s2 6.0 270 0
*end side
*end inner
*end outer
